  "statement": "I defend my requirements which emphasize ethical considerations and compliance within the library management system. RES-01 ensures data protection compliance through encryption, while RES-02 promotes inclusivity with an accessible interface. RES-03 logs user actions for accountability, RES-04 enforces fair borrowing limits, RES-05 ensures timely notifications for overdue books, RES-06 enables member feedback for continuous improvement, and RES-07 guarantees transparency with annual usage reports. These requirements are critical for fostering trust and responsibility in our library operations.",
